"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Sports Bars","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Burgers","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9--QS5ChKDYf4POHKujoiw","review_id":"MEBIugoOc6dZamWO-UjmiQ","date":"2010-11-17T16:11:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9376965761184692,"text_excerpt":"Order at the bar and enjoy people watching. They have pool tables, big screen TVs and the diviest of decor. The pulled pork was excellent; I smothered mine in BBQ sauce. The beans are served in a coffee mug and heavy on the onions but excellent in flavor...plus the beer is cheap! Cole slaw was unexpected (roughly cut strips with a salty, balsamic mayo dressing) that was better on my sandwich than as a side. Probably would not get coleslaw again but I recommend the place. :)"},{"business_id":"9--QS5ChKDYf4POHKujoiw","review_id":"NwOR9Hwo8BgqisQ9DJeRpA","date":"2017-10-28T18:53:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9368194341659546,"text_excerpt":"Good place to kick back, relax and eat some bbq. They have picnic benches inside, you order your food at the bar and then pick up by the kitchen when your buzzer goes off. You get little dog bowls to eat from (this was a cute concept). Inside is a bit dark, we had to use our phone lights to read the menu. We ordered the smoked chicken wings as appetizers and they were really good. The. We ordered 2 Ugly Dog Combo Platters : 1/2 chicken, pulled pork, ribs, burnt edges (of the brisket), coleslaw, biscuits, loaded baked potato and mac & cheese. This was all order for 4 people and there was enough for a dog bag to take home. (See what I did there) The chicken was a bit dry and flavorleas but ..."},{"business_id":"9--QS5ChKDYf4POHKujoiw","review_id":"Vr91gd2o4dD44JyEjRkpQQ","date":"2018-04-03T01:53:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9348711967468262,"text_excerpt":"Came here to have the crawfish for our first time. The crawfish wasn't hot and maybe if it was I would've enjoyed them more. But the bartender did tell us ahead of time. Aside from the crawfish, I got the 1/4 BBQ chicken and ribs with Mac n cheese. Now that's some gooooooood BBQ. If I'm liking my fingers while eating BBQ, you know it's great. The atmosphere has a Texas style BBQ ring to it. The bartenders were really nice too. I got the blood saison beer on tap which went great with my food."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9--QS5ChKDYf4POHKujoiw","photo_id":"MKgKowHy09OqdQ0LNu1xag","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MKgKowHy09OqdQ0LNu1xag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8552021980285645},{"business_id":"9--QS5ChKDYf4PO